{"verifySafeHtml() wraps I/O failures in RuntimeException instead of MojoExecutionException. When the derived _en.properties file is missing or unreadable, the raw exception escapes the catch (IOException e) in verify() and crashes the plugin instead of reporting a normal Maven error. Should propagate IOException to verify() or wrap in MojoExecutionException to match the method's declared exception type.": 0.9095409512519836}